            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Michael Stuart"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used a full cup of milk, all-purpose flour, and a tad more butter. IMPORTANT: If you use regular all-purpose flour instead of self-rising flour, then add a tablespoon of baking powder to the recipe! Otherwise, you'll end up with a hard brick. I always use regular all-purpose flour and make my self-rising flour this way whenever needed.",
